							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I&#039;d suggest all of you take your cocks out of each others&#039; hands, crawl out of the basement, and try to join the real world, but I wouldn&#039;t want to inflict your loathsome presence on anyone else.<br /><br />Lame insult? Please, the gay thing is soooo overdone.<br /></div><br />I think he is refering to a group of people posting their own flames while posting support of other group members&#039; flames in a cyclical fashion with the intention of bolstering each group members ego ala a circle jerk.
