	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12187"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864" title="View the profile of Zorlo">Zorlo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 43<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=864"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Zorlo65@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12187#msg12187"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12187#msg12187">Re: Reason why Flamevault is down</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> October 28, 2004, 10:29:37 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							lol ok thanks for the explanation...<br /><br />I was just saying i have never been to FV, and had no intention of irritating people, other then those that are offended by someone speaking their mind for fun on a rants and raves section. <br /><br />And the &quot;mighty rage&quot; of Callon? please, all he did was make a random string of sexually themed metaphors for a collection of people who insult others online. hooray. <br /><br />Should Callon invoke his almighty wrath again, i&#039;ll be surprised if he dosent reference an all gay orgy of insecurity or something. His blatant usage of homosexuality as an analogy for a forum online, would probably be interpereted by a psychologist as homosexual frustration itself.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
