								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg12206"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 326<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12206#msg12206"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12206#msg12206">Re: Reason why Flamevault is down</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> October 29, 2004, 12:19:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Zorlo, if you think I&#039;m genuinely angry about any of the recent posts here, you&#039;re even slower than I thought.&nbsp; <br /><br />I will explain my post to you slowly even though that&#039;s probably a waste of time too.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Quote<br />I guess you guys get off on spamming lame insults<br /><br />My post count is maybe 20? i dont know, maybe. besides:<br /></div><br />Post counts aside, the FV kiddies have most of their posts in just a couple of days, spamming this board with lame insults for no other reason than they&#039;re bored and it gives them a thrill somehow.&nbsp; It was also a statement about you guys getting an ego boost out of flaming on the internet, not necessarily just this board but in general.&nbsp; <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Lame insult? Please, the gay thing is soooo overdone.</div><br />Well Iniquitous already explained the insult to you since it was so clearly over your head.&nbsp; You then tried to dig your way out of looking stupid by flaming my use of sexually themed metaphors.&nbsp; Try again.&nbsp; You still look stupid.&nbsp; <br /><br />It&#039;s amusing that you whine about &quot;gay&quot; insults being so overdone (of course as was already explained I wasn&#039;t calling anyone gay), but you&#039;re&nbsp; cheering on someone who&#039;s flames mainly consist of &quot;you&#039;re retarded!&quot;.&nbsp; Ooo, that&#039;s impressive.&nbsp; Let&#039;s try it out.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">i&#039;ll be surprised if he dosent reference an all gay orgy of insecurity or something. His blatant usage of homosexuality as an analogy for a forum online, would probably be interpereted by a psychologist as homosexual frustration itself.</div><br />Wow!&nbsp; You&#039;re retarded!&nbsp; My brain dies a little bit more every time I see one of your posts.<br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
