								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Lol, it is really amazing that you think you are taking some sort of &quot;moral high ground&quot; in this issue.<br /><br />1. As i stated, but you were aparently so caught up in your zeal at responding to someone&#039;s flame, i have never been to FV. So saying i am an FV kiddie is like me saying your posts are inteligent.<br /><br />2. Also, for your metaphor: i know what you mean by your super clever circle jerk allusion.  I never said i didnt understand, just that the fact that you chose someone&#039;s sexual preferences as a means for an insult is demeaning to yourself. Quit with the bull shit, just because you have never encountered someone who wasn&#039;t blown away by your sexually frustrated humor, dosent mean they are wrong.<br /><br />3. I never cheered for TFA, i just said his posts were amusing, and interesting and they were. I mainly focused on how incoherent colleens posts were. <br /><br /><br />Please Callon, your pseudo-intellectual views are tired, your inability to properly express yourself without discrimanatory themes is idiotic, and your rationalization that someone knows words bigger then you isn&#039;t that i am smarter, or better read, but that i am &quot;gay&quot;.<br /><br />I don&#039;t doubt that you will have an equally witty response to this post, in which you contradict yourself even more.
