								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">1. As i stated, but you were aparently so caught up in your zeal at responding to someone&#039;s flame, i have never been to FV. So saying i am an FV kiddie is like me saying your posts are inteligent.</div><br />No, actually saying you&#039;re an FV kiddie is just like saying your the same ilk as they are. Really, it doesn&#039;t matter, for example, that you might have never been to the secret community in the desert exclusively for retards if you&#039;re retarded enough yourself to fit right in. Even if you&#039;ve never been there, parralels can still be drawn between your behaviour....<i>cause you&#039;re all friggin retarded</i>...<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">2. Also, for your metaphor: i know what you mean by your super clever circle jerk allusion.&nbsp; I never said i didnt understand, just that the fact that you chose someone&#039;s sexual preferences as a means for an insult is demeaning to yourself. Quit with the bull shit, just because you have never encountered someone who wasn&#039;t blown away by your sexually frustrated humor, dosent mean they are wrong.</div><br />Again, you&#039;re too caught up in the literal meaning. You can easily replace &#039;circle jerk&#039; with &#039;sitting around patting each other on the back for a job well done&#039; but hey, let&#039;s be honest, circle jerk just sounds funny :p<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">3. I never cheered for TFA, i just said his posts were amusing, and interesting and they were. I mainly focused on how incoherent colleens posts were.</div><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12136#msg12136">Quote from: Zorlo on October 27, 2004, 11:47:05 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><b>/cheer tfa</b><br /><br />Zorlo<br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /></div><br />LOL, and you wanted to give me shit for doing the exact thing I said shouldn&#039;t be done in the re: rant all you want thread? Maybe you&#039;re posting from the secret desert stronghold for the retard community right now. Tell Corky I said, &#039;wassup.&#039;<br /><br />Maybe you should just stick to picking apart gramatical errors in Colleen&#039;s posts. Oh wait, you can&#039;t even do that without fucking up.
