			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 326<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12304#msg12304"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12304#msg12304">Re: Reason why Flamevault is down</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> November 01, 2004, 01:49:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Self destruction already covered some of your BS, Zorlo... as for the rest...<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Lol, it is really amazing that you think you are taking some sort of &quot;moral high ground&quot; in this issue.<br /></div><br />Well, I&#039;ve wasted a little time insulting the fucktards who&#039;s idea of fun when their board goes down is to show up at some other board and troll.&nbsp; They sought us out, not vice-versa.&nbsp; So is that the moral high ground?&nbsp; *shrug*&nbsp; I don&#039;t particularly care.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">2. Also, for your metaphor: i know what you mean by your super clever circle jerk allusion.&nbsp; I never said i didnt understand, just that the fact that you chose someone&#039;s sexual preferences as a means for an insult is demeaning to yourself. Quit with the bull shit, just because you have never encountered someone who wasn&#039;t blown away by your sexually frustrated humor, dosent mean they are wrong.</div><br />Your first response to me made it very clear that you didn&#039;t understand.&nbsp; You then thanked Iniquitous for explaining it to you.&nbsp; Now you try to claim that you did understand, blah blah... sorry, it doesn&#039;t work.&nbsp; You still look stupid.&nbsp; And the circle jerk metaphor is absolutely not the same as calling someone &quot;gay&quot; (which isn&#039;t even really an insult... &quot;omg, you&#039;re gay!&quot;....).&nbsp; I thought this was already explained to you, but you&#039;re either remarkably slow or willfully ignoring things so you can keep trolling.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Please Callon, your pseudo-intellectual views are tired, your inability to properly express yourself without discrimanatory themes is idiotic, and your rationalization that someone knows words bigger then you isn&#039;t that i am smarter, or better read, but that i am &quot;gay&quot;.</div><br />This from a guy who trumpets his superb intellect in another thread.&nbsp; If the brains are there, you don&#039;t have to go around telling people how smart you are.&nbsp; In your case though, your posts make you look slow so you have to tell us &quot;noooo... i r smart!&quot;.&nbsp; btw, I haven&#039;t said a thing about your &quot;big words&quot;, which I don&#039;t find big anyway.&nbsp; You&#039;re mixing up who&#039;s posts you&#039;re responding to again. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I don&#039;t doubt that you will have an equally witty response to this post, in which you contradict yourself even more.</div><br />Well since I haven&#039;t contradicted myself, try again.&nbsp; Admittedly though I&#039;m doing one stupid and pointless thing, wasting time responding to your board trolling. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
