			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=823" title="View the profile of Cateire">Cateire</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 8<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/rage.bmp" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=823"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:cjtigger@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12324#msg12324"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1216.msg12324#msg12324">Re: Reason why Flamevault is down</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> November 02, 2004, 05:07:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Well since I haven&#039;t contradicted myself, try again.  Admittedly though I&#039;m doing one stupid and pointless thing, wasting time responding to your board trolling.   <br /></div><br />Oh come on, It&#039;s fun, you know it.  Personally, I&#039;m here at work and have a slow night, so this is quite entertaining. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"><br />2. Also, for your metaphor: i know what you mean by your super clever circle jerk allusion.  I never said i didnt understand, just that the fact that you chose someone&#039;s sexual preferences as a means for an insult is demeaning to yourself. Quit with the bull shit, just because you have never encountered someone who wasn&#039;t blown away by your sexually frustrated humor, dosent mean they are wrong.<br /></div><br />However, I&#039;m dumfounded as to how sexual preference bashing was even able to be gleaned from Callon&#039;s post so I examined Zorlo&#039;s posts to in an effort to understand. (remember I&#039;m really bored). I&#039;ve come up with 3 possible conclusions. <br /><br />1. Zorlo is actually a homosexual.  Which isn&#039;t a bad thing but, if he were, then by his own personal experiance of having a cock in his hand.  I could see why he might have been offended or was able to twist the &quot;circle jerk&quot; metaphore from it&#039;s intended meaning. Into what he claims to be a bash on sexual preference. <br /><br />2. Zorlo has no real reading comprehension. No substantial explaination here just stating a simple fact. I mean, this isn&#039;t George Orwell&#039;s Short story &quot; A Hanging&quot;. There is no hidden plot or meaning. It is a message forum for the love of god. <br /><br />3. Zorlo is trying to be cool in front of his friends while trolling and thus only reenforcing Callon&#039;s original intent of the &quot;circle jerk&quot; metaphor.<br /><br />Zorlo, is my favorite type of flamer. They come on strong and then kind of just fizzle away. They have no real personal ethics  or standards. They just flame for the heck of it. When they run into an educated person during their &quot;flamming session&quot; they spend all their precious basement trolling time trying to convince everyone how smart, or moraly devout they are, and how stupid the person or topic they are flaming is.  When in all actuality, they are only trying to convince themselves and failing miserably at it. <br /><br />One might debate, well Cat WTF are you doing by posting you are doing the same thing. <br /><br />Well I counter that with the simple fact that I am doing it for the pure fun of it <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bonk.gif" alt="Bonk" border="0" /><br /><br />PS: for all you grammar and spelling Natzi&#039;s  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/eat-me.gif" alt="Eat ME!!" border="0" />  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/hugs00.gif" alt="hugs00" border="0" /> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Marshall Cateire<br />Union Of Power<br /><br />&quot;Cant you just let me go to hell the way I want to&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
